			"Message": "build(Wind): Update TypeScript incremental build info\n\nThe tsconfig.tsbuildinfo file was regenerated following TypeScript compilation triggered by the service interface and catalog regeneration in the previous commit. The dependency graph and file hash entries are refreshed to reflect the updated source set.\n\nNo functional changes — build artifact only.",
